180-## 3. Port types & compatibility matrix
181-
182:Types (v1): `control, text, script, project_id, project_settings, audio_file, tts_metadata, alignment, segments, scenes, image_prompts, storyboard_images, animation_assets, captions, music_track, editor_project, export_profile, video_file, generic_json`.
183-
184:Compatibility rule: **exact type match only.** No wildcard: `generic_json` connects only to `generic_json`. `stub.input`/`stub.output` resolve their dynamic type from configuration at validation time and then obey exact-match. Additional rules: no in→in / out→out; single-value inputs reject a second edge; DAG only (cycle rejection); control edges distinct from data edges. Every payload that references files carries `{artifact_refs: [relpaths]}` alongside inline JSON; integrity check = existence + nonzero size.
185-
186:### 3.1 Stable port IDs and control readiness
187-
188:Type names alone are not port IDs. Registry entries and persisted edges use the following
189-stable IDs; renaming a display label never changes them.
190-
191-| node type | inputs (`id:type`, `?` optional) | outputs (`id:type`) |
192-|---|---|---|
193:| `trigger.manual` | — | `control:control` |
194:| `project.setup` | `trigger:control?` | `control:control`, `settings:project_settings` |
195:| `script.input` | `trigger:control?` | `control:control`, `script:script` |
196:| `project.existing` | `trigger:control?` | `control:control`, `project_id:project_id`, `project:editor_project` |
197:| `tts.generate` | `trigger:control?`, `script:script`, `settings:project_settings?` | `control:control`, `audio:audio_file`, `metadata:tts_metadata` |
198:| `timing.align` | `trigger:control?`, `audio:audio_file`, `script:script` | `control:control`, `alignment:alignment` |
199:| `segment.run` | `trigger:control?`, `alignment:alignment` | `control:control`, `segments:segments` |
200:| `scenes.blueprint` | `trigger:control?`, `segments:segments`, `script:script`, `settings:project_settings?` | `control:control`, `scenes:scenes`, `image_prompts:image_prompts` |
201:| `storyboard.generate` | `trigger:control?`, `scenes:scenes`, `settings:project_settings?` | `control:control`, `images:storyboard_images` |
202:| `animator.generate` | `trigger:control?`, `scenes:scenes`, `storyboard:storyboard_images?`, `settings:project_settings?` | `control:control`, `assets:animation_assets` |
203:| `captions.generate` | `trigger:control?`, `alignment:alignment` | `control:control`, `captions:captions` |
204:| `music.select` | `trigger:control?`, `settings:project_settings?`, `project_id:project_id?` | `control:control`, `track:music_track` |
205:| `assemble.project` | `trigger:control?`, `assets:animation_assets`, `metadata:tts_metadata`, `scenes:scenes`, `captions:captions?`, `music:music_track?`, `settings:project_settings?` | `control:control`, `project:editor_project` |
206:| `timeline.project` | `trigger:control?`, `project:editor_project` | `control:control`, `project:editor_project`, `project_id:project_id` |
207:| `export.video` | `trigger:control?`, `project:editor_project`, `settings:project_settings?` | `control:control`, `video:video_file` |
208:| `workflow.output` | `trigger:control?`, `value:<dynamic>` | — |
